    "Note where frameworks disagree and why; choose with an explicit rationale."
  ],
  "quality_checks": [
    "each framework applied explicitly",
    "tradeoffs documented"
  ],
  "failure_modes": [
    "mixing frameworks without noticing",
    "ignoring affected stakeholders"
  ],
